            "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112657689558040576/vid/avc1/3840x2160/pqg2GFg_Qs5TMBIi.mp4?tag=29",
            "width": 3840
          }
        ],
        "name": "Californians for Voter ID, Yes on 39",
        "text": "Prop 39 released a new ad today highlighting what politicians don’t want you to know: California is one of a handful of states that don’t require a photo ID to vote.\n\nProp 39 is a battle of politicians versus people.\n\nPoliticians want you to vote no.\nThe People are voting yes.\n\nThis ad is a parody, but the problem is not.\n\nThe politicians want to protect their power and money. We want to give it back to you.\n\nVote Yes on Prop 39.\nDonate: http://efundraisingconnections.com/c/CaliforniansforVoterID",
        "url": "https://x.com/ca4voterid/status/2112921851974619629",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
