        "name": "Katie Miller",
        "text": "“Well, to be honest, Elon Musk is paying the most money in the country right now with this SpaceX little job that they got down there in Southaven, you know what I’m saying. It’s a killing,” said Ray Massey, who also traveled from Gulfport, Mississippi, in hopes of data center work.”\n\nOne electrician had a message for Elon Musk about the work.\n\n“Tell Elon Musk to stay, we love this money you’re giving us man,” the electrician said.",
