      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "Talarico would vote to take away your kids and transition them, not just in Texas, but nationwide. \n\nPure evil.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "KanekoaTheGreat",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1612188077333835776/qxjhM55m_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-22 01:10:33",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-21T17:10:33.000Z",
        "id": "2112954705634902429",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112952812502151168/img/IaLVPECGC_UmccLf.jpg"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "duration": 245.666,
            "height": 1080,
            "thumbnail_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112952812502151168/img/IaLVPECGC_UmccLf.jpg",
            "type": "video",
            "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112952812502151168/vid/avc1/1920x1080/0ayekWfZTSFA7jZw.mp4?tag=29",
            "width": 1920
          }
        ],
        "name": "KanekoaTheGreat",
        "text": "Every word is James Talarico’s.\n\n27 clips. 4 minutes. 2019–2026.\n\n“God is non-binary.”\n\n“…many more than two biological sexes. In fact, there are six.”\n\n“If you deny your child’s gender identity… it’s abusive for sure.”\n\n“There’s only one person who can determine a child’s gender identity, and that’s the child.”\n\n“I want to acknowledge that our trans community needs abortion care too.”\n\n“…the bill that would have denied gender-affirming health care to trans children… All these ideologies stem from this Christofascism movement.”\n\n“The way I fought for trans kids in the legislature is how I will fight for the U.S. Senate, and my position hasn’t changed.”\n\n“Prophetic voices like Jesus have helped me reckon with my own whiteness.”\n\n“It’s always rich to me that defund the police is considered off limits…”\n\n“Prison is violence.”\n\n“Tear down this secret police force.”\n\nAssault weapons ban? “Absolutely.”\n\nSend this to 10 Texas voters and tell them to vote today.",
        "url": "https://x.com/KanekoaTheGreat/status/2112954705634902429",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
